---
// Quiz figure, set 03/04: the inputs of one Bayes step (prior 0.10 turbulent; likelihoods calm 0.2, turbulent 0.8).
---
<div class="qfig-atq05b">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 250" role="img" aria-label="Inputs to one filtering step. Prior belief: 10 percent turbulent, 90 percent calm. Likelihood of today's return: 0.8 under turbulent, 0.2 under calm.">
    <text x="0" y="20" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Inputs to one filtering step</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Đầu vào của một bước lọc</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="0" y="56" class="t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Belief before today's return</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Niềm tin trước lợi suất hôm nay</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="0" y="66" width="540" height="28" rx="4" class="calm" />
    <rect x="0" y="66" width="54" height="28" rx="4" class="turb" />
    <text x="62" y="86" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>10% turbulent</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>10% hỗn loạn</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="400" y="86" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>90% calm</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>90% yên</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="0" y="140" class="t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>How likely today's return is under each state</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Lợi suất hôm nay có khả năng bao nhiêu ở mỗi trạng thái</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="0" y="152" width={0.2 * 540} height="26" rx="4" class="calm" />
    <text x={0.2 * 540 + 10} y="171" class="v">
      <tspan data-lang-en>calm: 0.2</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>yên: 0,2</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="0" y="190" width={0.8 * 540} height="26" rx="4" class="turb" />
    <text x={0.8 * 540 + 10} y="209" class="v">
      <tspan data-lang-en>turbulent: 0.8</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>hỗn loạn: 0,8</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>
<style>
  .qfig-atq05b { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-atq05b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-atq05b text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .qfig-atq05b .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-atq05b .t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-atq05b .m { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-atq05b .v { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-atq05b .calm { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .qfig-atq05b .turb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
</style>
